To update a voice:

 - ensure that <voice>/<segment>.sh contains a midi note

   VOICE_MIDI_NOTE=50

 - ensure that <voice>/<segment>.txt contains labels

 - run

   update-voice.sh <voice> <segment> /path/to/new/voice.flac

   this will upload the new flac file with checksum to space.twc.de,
             replace <voice>/<segment>.flac and compute checksum / upload
             <voice>/<segment>.sm
             <voice>/<segment>.volume

